# Commits that changed formatting only, and should be skipped by git blame.
#
# A repo-wide formatting pass rewrites thousands of lines without changing
# a single behaviour, and without this file it would make `git blame`
# useless — every line would attribute to the reformat instead of to the
# change that actually introduced it.
#
# Enable it once, locally:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub honours this file automatically in its blame view.
#
# Add only pure-formatting commits. One full 40-character SHA per line,
# with a comment saying what it was.

